    "title": "Boat Trader",
    "description": "Find your next boat with Boat Trader. Search the largest marketplace for new and used boats for sale in the U.S.\r\n\r\nTop 3 Features\r\n1. Use our extensive set of filters and sorting options to narrow down your choices to your perfect boat.\r\n2. View photos and detailed specs of boats for sale across the U.S.\r\n3. Research over 100,000 different boat types and models, compare prices and features, and find the perfect dealer or private seller.\r\n\r\nNot sure which type of boat you want? Boat Trader makes buying a boat easy and, most importantly - fun. Browse more than 100,000 ski/wake, fishing, pontoon and cruising boats and yachts. View boats for sale near you or search within a specific distance, price range, size, type or brand. Your recently viewed boats are saved so you can visit them again, and when you\u2019re ready to take the next step, it\u2019s easy to contact the seller directly.\r\n\r\nBoat Trader is the most popular boating marketplace in the U.S. for all types of boaters - experienced or novice. With access to more boats and resources than any other source in the U.S., you\u2019ll have everything you need to get on the water.",
